OL,3,GNEWSASign returns to square named after
OL,4,Aslave trader
OL,5,
OL,6,FA controversial street sign has been
OL,7,Freinstalled in a square named after
OL,8,FEngland's first slave trader.
OL,10,FThe Sir John Hawkins Square sign was
OL,11,Fremoved six years ago by Plymouth City
OL,12,FCouncil following Black Lives Matter
OL,13,Fprotests.
OL,15,FThe council proposed to rename the
OL,16,Flocation Justice Square in 2023 but was
OL,17,Funable to do so following a legal
OL,18,Fchallenge and a change in the law
OL,19,Fregarding street naming.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
