OL,3,GNEWSASign returns to square named after
OL,4,Aslave trader
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor John Stephens, cabinet
OL,7,Fmember for strategic planning and
OL,8,Ftransport, said the authority had put
OL,9,Fthe sign back. He said the council
OL,10,Fplanned to create a QR code alongside
OL,11,Fit for people to learn about Hawkins'
OL,12,Frole in "one of the darkest chapters in
OL,13,Four history".
